@startuml
title UC-17 - Platform effectiveness report and baseline
autonumber
actor "Platform Engineer / Admin" as PE
boundary EffectivenessPage as UI
control EffectivenessService as Svc
control WorkItemBuilder as Items
control MetricCatalog as Catalog
database "Deployment / cleanup history" as History
database BaselineRepository as Baselines

PE -> UI: Open report (default: organization, 30 days)
UI -> Svc: GET report(from, to, application?, workload?)
Svc -> Svc: Session role PE/Admin, Organization scope,\nnormalize period (Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh)
Svc -> History: Read runs of Organization (read snapshot)
History --> Svc: Deployments, USER_CONFIRMED cleanups, users, applications
Svc -> Items: Build logical work items from runs
Items --> Svc: Completed / open items with attempts
Svc -> Baselines: Effective baseline version for scope at period end
Svc -> Catalog: Compute every catalog entry for scope
Catalog --> Svc: value, numerator/denominator, coverage,\nCOLLECTED | NO_DATA | NOT_COLLECTED
Svc --> UI: Report + child-scope breakdown + trend
PE -> UI: Open metric detail
UI -> Svc: GET records(metric, same filters)
Svc --> UI: Source records (IDs link to UC-09 history)
PE -> UI: Export CSV
UI -> UI: Format server report + records\n(no recomputation)
PE -> UI: Save baseline version
UI -> Svc: POST baseline(expectedVersion, value, source, effectiveFrom)
Svc -> Baselines: Insert version expectedVersion+1 (CAS)
alt version changed
  Baselines --> UI: VERSION_CONFLICT, nothing written
else inserted
  Baselines --> UI: New version (older versions unchanged)
end
note over History
Read-only. No executor, provider or cluster call.
No secrets, inputs, outputs or failure reasons returned.
end note
@enduml
